I have been able to initialize a TK-50 in a TK-70 drive and vice-versa in the
followin manner:

Step 1:  Get a very strong magnet
Step 2:  Rub the tape in question against the magnet for a few seconds
Step 3:  Insert the tape into tape drive and initialize

Note: Do not perform this procedure in your tape library. Probably a good idea
to keep the magnet out of your machine room too.



