 To transfer from VMS to Ultrix using TCP/IP, run ftp on the
 Ultrix machine. Be sure to set the file type to binary before
 you try to transfer the file(s) from the VMS machine, i.e.
 something like:

   # ftp vmsnode
   ....connection messages
   ftp> binary
   200 Type set to I.
   ftp> get filename

 You should now have the file on your Ultrix machine. 

 Now, go to the VMS machine and use EXCHANGE/NET to copy the file
 from the Ultrix machine, e.g.

   $ EXCHANGE/NET ultrixnode::"/pub/foo.bar" [blah]foo.bar 

 The file(s) should now be on your destination machine (hopefully 8-)).

 /jim

 


