Your IOZONE measurements are measuring the speed of the buffer cache on the
DECstation and the speed of the disk on the VMS system. Arrange for proper
caching of the file on VMS (or for synchronous behaviour on the ULTRIX system)
and they'll perform about the same.

Simple benchmarks (like IOZONE) are only useful if you understand what
they're measuring..
