> the same so our boards work.  The end result is that boards from the 
> DECstation family are compatible with the hardware.  Now, software drivers 
> (especially for third parties) and availability is another question that I 
> don't have answers for right now.

  All of the existing Alpha TURBOchannel based machines (and there are more
  than a couple of designs) are TURBOchannel compliant. Any TURBOchannel
  option which is compliant to the existing TURBOchannel specification (which
  is version 2C) will have hardware support in these systems.

  As for the device driver interfaces for various operating systems, that is
  dependent upon the option vendors priority list. But, to be fair, it's 
  even more dependent upon TRI/ADD getting them the documentation to do the
  work. We have a set GOAL that all of the TURBOchannel option vendors who
  want to be in place when systems and support are announced be there. We do
