>the Assembler and File System.  Removable media - two LINCtape drives,
>of course.  The predecessor of DECtape, each spool holds 512 blocks of
>256 12-bit words, or 512 bytes - the characters (upper-case, plus
>various greek and math symbols) fit into 6 bits.
