On certain generation VT100's, sending the 'set smooth scroll' sequence,
followed immediately by the 'set jump scroll' sequence causes the screen
to scroll both upward *and* downward from the middle, with two cursors
displayed. All displayed text appears both on line 12 and 13, and line
feeds cause line 12 to move to line 11, while line 13 moves to line 14,
and so on.

Aren't computers fun?

