Basicly, you do two things :

1. Get yourself a postscript file ( without page shown )

   Example :

%!  Logo
 0.5 0.5 0.5 setrgbcolor
 newpath 0 50 moveto 1000 50 lineto 1000 200 lineto 0 200 lineto 0 50
lineto fill
 stroke
 1.0 0.0 0.0 setrgbcolor
/Helvetica-Bold findfont
50 scalefont setfont
360 150 moveto (cygnusx1) show
 1.0 1.0 0.0 setrgbcolor
/Helvetica-Bold findfont
25 scalefont setfont
200 100 moveto (DECstation 5000/200 TX, MultiMedia Station) show
 0.0 1.0 0.0 setrgbcolor
/Helvetica-Bold findfont
10 scalefont setfont
200 75 moveto (Dominique Dierick 7548 ) show

2. Change /usr/lib/X11/app-defaults/XSessionManager

    Add in there :

