I add the following lines to my $HOME/.xsession file:

xmodmap -e 'keysym comma = comma less'
xmodmap -e 'keysym period = period greater'
xmodmap -e 'keycode 191 = Escape'
xmodmap -e 'keycode 201 = grave asciitilde'

