amolitor@eagle.wesleyan.edu writes:
|> 	I'd kind of like to know why it's cool for Sun to orphan
|> 3's after a few years, and everyone sorta applauds the march of
|> technology, while DEC gets all kinds of abuse if they even *hint*
|> about orphaning a product in a similar, or even longer, interval.
|> 
|> 	I suppose it's a good way to slide a nice feel-good VMS
|> bash onto Usenet, at any rate.
|> 
|> 	Andrew
